{
 "kind": "cards",
 "source": "card-text",
 "slug": "pfin",
 "url": "https://scryfall.com/sets/pfin",
 "title": "Final Fantasy Promos: card flavor text",
 "description": "",
 "published": "2025-06-13",
 "modified": "",
 "story_date": "2025-06-13",
 "authors": [],
 "storyline_nav": null,
 "paragraphs": [
  {
   "text": "\"I shall remain here and devote myself to the care of the wounded.\"",
   "scene": 0,
   "card": "Minwu, White Mage",
   "url": "https://scryfall.com/card/pfin/26s/minwu-white-mage"
  },
  {
   "text": "\"Thanks, moogles! We're in your debt!\" —Locke Cole",
   "scene": 0,
   "card": "Moogles' Valor",
   "url": "https://scryfall.com/card/pfin/27s/moogles-valor"
  },
  {
   "text": "\"How about a three-piece combo of Hi-Potion, Ether, and Phoenix Pinion for 444 Gil?\"",
   "scene": 0,
   "card": "Stiltzkin, Moogle Merchant",
   "url": "https://scryfall.com/card/pfin/34s/stiltzkin-moogle-merchant"
  },
  {
   "text": "\"Such devastation ... this was not my intention!\" —Gaius van Baelsar",
   "scene": 0,
   "card": "Ultima",
   "url": "https://scryfall.com/card/pfin/38s/ultima"
  },
  {
   "text": "\"Show me your strength of will!\"",
   "scene": 0,
   "card": "Venat, Heart of Hydaelyn",
   "url": "https://scryfall.com/card/pfin/39s/venat-heart-of-hydaelyn-hydaelyn-the-mothercrystal"
  },
  {
   "text": "\"For the sake of all, I beseech thee: deliver us from this fate!\"",
   "scene": 0,
   "card": "Hydaelyn, the Mothercrystal",
   "url": "https://scryfall.com/card/pfin/39s/venat-heart-of-hydaelyn-hydaelyn-the-mothercrystal"
  },
  {
   "text": "\"I give unto you the last of my light, and with it, the last hope of a fading world.\"",
   "scene": 0,
   "card": "The Wind Crystal",
   "url": "https://scryfall.com/card/pfin/43s/the-wind-crystal"
  },
  {
   "text": "\"Sabin...let's settle this with the toss of a coin.\"",
   "scene": 0,
   "card": "Edgar, King of Figaro",
   "url": "https://scryfall.com/card/pfin/51s/edgar-king-of-figaro"
  },
  {
   "text": "\"I see... so, you seek to save the world. Then I guess that means I shall save the world as well. Lead on! I will copy your every move.\"",
   "scene": 0,
   "card": "Gogo, Master of Mimicry",
   "url": "https://scryfall.com/card/pfin/54s/gogo-master-of-mimicry"
  },
  {
   "text": "\"I'm going to help you. To give you what you need to protect us all.\"",
   "scene": 0,
   "card": "Jill, Shiva's Dominant",
   "url": "https://scryfall.com/card/pfin/58s/jill-shivas-dominant-shiva-warden-of-ice"
  },
  {
   "text": "\"I will be your monster no more.\"",
   "scene": 0,
   "card": "Shiva, Warden of Ice",
   "url": "https://scryfall.com/card/pfin/58s/jill-shivas-dominant-shiva-warden-of-ice"
  },
  {
   "text": "\"Thank you... for everything... Pray take your rest, Grandfather... You deserve it.\" —Alisaie Leveilleur",
   "scene": 0,
   "card": "Louisoix's Sacrifice",
   "url": "https://scryfall.com/card/pfin/59s/louisoixs-sacrifice"
  },
  {
   "text": "\"Don't you know it's rude to enter without knocking? Hmph, the youth of today...\"",
   "scene": 0,
   "card": "Matoya, Archon Elder",
   "url": "https://scryfall.com/card/pfin/62s/matoya-archon-elder"
  },
  {
   "text": "\"Crystal of water, may you regain your light.\" —Aria Benett",
   "scene": 0,
   "card": "The Water Crystal",
   "url": "https://scryfall.com/card/pfin/85s/the-water-crystal"
  },
  {
   "text": "\"As I suspected, the aetheric disturbance here is no natural occurrence.\"",
   "scene": 0,
   "card": "Y'shtola Rhul",
   "url": "https://scryfall.com/card/pfin/86s/yshtola-rhul"
  },
  {
   "text": "\"I suppose this is my fate as a dark knight. Soon, I won't even feel remorse for my actions.\"",
   "scene": 0,
   "card": "Cecil, Dark Knight",
   "url": "https://scryfall.com/card/pfin/91s/cecil-dark-knight-cecil-redeemed-paladin"
  },
  {
   "text": "\"This is my battle, one I must fight alone to atone for my wrongs.\"",
   "scene": 0,
   "card": "Cecil, Redeemed Paladin",
   "url": "https://scryfall.com/card/pfin/91s/cecil-dark-knight-cecil-redeemed-paladin"
  },
  {
   "text": "\"Fare you well, Bringer of Light.\"",
   "scene": 0,
   "card": "Dark Confidant",
   "url": "https://scryfall.com/card/pfin/94s/dark-confidant"
  },
  {
   "text": "\"Well, well, trying to follow in my footsteps, are you?\"",
   "scene": 0,
   "card": "Jecht, Reluctant Guardian",
   "url": "https://scryfall.com/card/pfin/104s/jecht-reluctant-guardian-braskas-final-aeon"
  },
  {
   "text": "The elder primal Odin has returned to Eorzea.",
   "scene": 0,
   "card": "Summon: Primal Odin",
   "url": "https://scryfall.com/card/pfin/121s/summon:-primal-odin"
  },
  {
   "text": "\"This body is... the punishment that's been given to me...\"",
   "scene": 0,
   "card": "Galian Beast",
   "url": "https://scryfall.com/card/pfin/125s/vincent-valentine-galian-beast"
  },
  {
   "text": "\"The heavens are too small a field for our dance. Let us transcend this mortal coil!\"",
   "scene": 0,
   "card": "Shinryu, Transcendent Rival",
   "url": "https://scryfall.com/card/pfin/127s/zenos-yae-galvus-shinryu-transcendent-rival"
  },
  {
   "text": "\"Let the flames burn within you! No... let them burn without!\"",
   "scene": 0,
   "card": "Ifrit, Warden of Inferno",
   "url": "https://scryfall.com/card/pfin/133s/clive-ifrits-dominant-ifrit-warden-of-inferno"
  },
  {
   "text": "\"Warriors of Light...Only you can restore hope to the world, for yours is the light that can balance out the darkness...\"",
   "scene": 0,
   "card": "The Fire Crystal",
   "url": "https://scryfall.com/card/pfin/135s/the-fire-crystal"
  },
  {
   "text": "\"Come, then! Who will be next to die on my steel!?\"",
   "scene": 0,
   "card": "Raubahn, Bull of Ala Mhigo",
   "url": "https://scryfall.com/card/pfin/151s/raubahn-bull-of-ala-mhigo"
  },
  {
   "text": "A name in blood, a pact of flame.",
   "scene": 0,
   "card": "Summon: Brynhildr",
   "url": "https://scryfall.com/card/pfin/160s/summon:-brynhildr"
  },
  {
   "text": "\"Pretty confident. Let's see how you do.\"",
   "scene": 0,
   "card": "Summon: G.F. Cerberus",
   "url": "https://scryfall.com/card/pfin/162s/summon:-gf-cerberus"
  },
  {
   "text": "\"My weapons are these fists of mine!\"",
   "scene": 0,
   "card": "Zell Dincht",
   "url": "https://scryfall.com/card/pfin/170s/zell-dincht"
  },
  {
   "text": "\"Call me Bartz. Me and my chocobo just go wherever the trail leads us...\"",
   "scene": 0,
   "card": "Bartz and Boko",
   "url": "https://scryfall.com/card/pfin/175s/bartz-and-boko"
  },
  {
   "text": "\"I've chosen a name for her . . . Terra.\"",
   "scene": 0,
   "card": "Summon: Esper Maduin",
   "url": "https://scryfall.com/card/pfin/185s/esper-origins-summon:-esper-maduin"
  },
  {
   "text": "Some Cactuars live long lives and grow huge. This Jumbo Cactuar is one of them.",
   "scene": 0,
   "card": "Jumbo Cactuar",
   "url": "https://scryfall.com/card/pfin/191s/jumbo-cactuar"
  },
  {
   "text": "\"The Seventh Astral Era is come!\"",
   "scene": 0,
   "card": "A Realm Reborn",
   "url": "https://scryfall.com/card/pfin/196s/a-realm-reborn"
  },
  {
   "text": "\"Chocobo, we just can't catch a break, can we?\"",
   "scene": 0,
   "card": "Sazh Katzroy",
   "url": "https://scryfall.com/card/pfin/199s/sazh-katzroy"
  },
  {
   "text": "\"I'm pretty good at taking care of myself, you know.\"",
   "scene": 0,
   "card": "Tifa Lockhart",
   "url": "https://scryfall.com/card/pfin/206s/tifa-lockhart"
  },
  {
   "text": "\"What will become of our triumphs? Our hopes? Our... our despair?\"",
   "scene": 0,
   "card": "Hades, Sorcerer of Eld",
   "url": "https://scryfall.com/card/pfin/218s/emet-selch-unsundered-hades-sorcerer-of-eld"
  },
  {
   "text": "\"If we have the power to destroy Cocoon, then we have the power to save it.\"",
   "scene": 0,
   "card": "Hope Estheim",
   "url": "https://scryfall.com/card/pfin/226s/hope-estheim"
  },
  {
   "text": "\"In ashen grip, let ember glow, to kindle flames anew.\"",
   "scene": 0,
   "card": "Joshua, Phoenix's Dominant",
   "url": "https://scryfall.com/card/pfin/229s/joshua-phoenixs-dominant-phoenix-warden-of-fire"
  },
  {
   "text": "The end draws near.",
   "scene": 0,
   "card": "Kefka, Ruler of Ruin",
   "url": "https://scryfall.com/card/pfin/231s/kefka-court-mage-kefka-ruler-of-ruin"
  },
  {
   "text": "\"Peace is but a shadow of death, desperate to forget its painful past...\"",
   "scene": 0,
   "card": "Kuja, Genome Sorcerer",
   "url": "https://scryfall.com/card/pfin/232s/kuja-genome-sorcerer-trance-kuja-fate-defied"
  },
  {
   "text": "\"Yes, this is it! This is the power I've always wanted!\"",
   "scene": 0,
   "card": "Trance Kuja, Fate Defied",
   "url": "https://scryfall.com/card/pfin/232s/kuja-genome-sorcerer-trance-kuja-fate-defied"
  },
  {
   "text": "\"Lightning. It flashes bright, then fades away. It can't protect. It only destroys.\"",
   "scene": 0,
   "card": "Lightning, Army of One",
   "url": "https://scryfall.com/card/pfin/233s/lightning-army-of-one"
  },
  {
   "text": "Many sacrificed all for the King; so must the King sacrifice himself for all.",
   "scene": 0,
   "card": "Noctis, Prince of Lucis",
   "url": "https://scryfall.com/card/pfin/235s/noctis-prince-of-lucis"
  },
  {
   "text": "\"Our own private heaven.\"",
   "scene": 0,
   "card": "Serah Farron",
   "url": "https://scryfall.com/card/pfin/240s/serah-farron-crystallized-serah"
  },
  {
   "text": "L'Cie who fulfill their Focus for their fal'Cie master are transformed into crystal and granted life eternal.",
   "scene": 0,
   "card": "Crystallized Serah",
   "url": "https://scryfall.com/card/pfin/240s/serah-farron-crystallized-serah"
  },
  {
   "text": "\"The pinnacle o' perfection, forged from blood, sweat, an' tears!\" —Gerolt Blackthorne",
   "scene": 0,
   "card": "Aettir and Priwen",
   "url": "https://scryfall.com/card/pfin/253s/aettir-and-priwen"
  },
  {
   "text": "The ultimate sword, used by a legendary king. It was forged in another world.",
   "scene": 0,
   "card": "Excalibur II",
   "url": "https://scryfall.com/card/pfin/257s/excalibur-ii"
  },
  {
   "text": "\"I must say, I quite enjoy these tussles.\"",
   "scene": 0,
   "card": "Genji Glove",
   "url": "https://scryfall.com/card/pfin/258s/genji-glove"
  },
  {
   "text": "A great and proud nation devoted to Halone, the Fury.",
   "scene": 0,
   "card": "Ishgard, the Holy See",
   "url": "https://scryfall.com/card/pfin/283s/ishgard-the-holy-see-faith-&-grief"
  },
  {
   "text": "\"You're the spitting image of Maria!\" —Jidoor resident",
   "scene": 0,
   "card": "Jidoor, Aristocratic Capital",
   "url": "https://scryfall.com/card/pfin/284s/jidoor-aristocratic-capital-overture"
  },
  {
   "text": "A city encircled by the ramparts of a massive castle.",
   "scene": 0,
   "card": "Lindblum, Industrial Regency",
   "url": "https://scryfall.com/card/pfin/285s/lindblum-industrial-regency-mage-siege"
  },
  {
   "text": "A triumph of technology and testament to man's potential.",
   "scene": 0,
   "card": "Midgar, City of Mako",
   "url": "https://scryfall.com/card/pfin/286s/midgar-city-of-mako-reactor-raid"
  },
  {
   "text": "When darkness veils the world, four Warriors of Light shall come.",
   "scene": 0,
   "card": "Starting Town",
   "url": "https://scryfall.com/card/pfin/289s/starting-town"
  },
  {
   "text": "A city dead for a thousand years. The end of Yuna's journey.",
   "scene": 0,
   "card": "Zanarkand, Ancient Metropolis",
   "url": "https://scryfall.com/card/pfin/293s/zanarkand-ancient-metropolis-lasting-fayth"
  }
 ]
}
